From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:01:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [GStreamer] Add a hole-punch quirk for Kodi

Kodi shows the video of the web pages it hosts on a display plane
underneath the page. The kodi hole-punch quirk renders video into
kodivideosink, which hands the decoded frames to Kodi, and passes the
rectangle the hole is punched at to the sink, so Kodi places the plane
there. The page stays transparent where the video shows through,
whatever it paints underneath.
---
 .../gstreamer/GStreamerHolePunchQuirkKodi.h   | 54 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../platform/gstreamer/GStreamerQuirks.cpp    |  5 +-
 2 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 Source/WebCore/platform/gstreamer/GStreamerHolePunchQuirkKodi.h

--- /dev/null
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/gstreamer/GStreamerHolePunchQuirkKodi.h
@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@
